stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Submitted: POST /api/requests
  Submitted --> SecurityApproval: Manager approves (sensitive category)
  Submitted --> ItProcessing: Manager approves (other category)
  SecurityApproval --> ItProcessing: SecurityReviewer approves
  ItProcessing --> Provisioned: ItAdmin approves
  Provisioned --> Closed: requester POST /confirm
  Submitted --> Rejected: Manager rejects
  SecurityApproval --> Rejected: SecurityReviewer rejects
  ItProcessing --> Rejected: ItAdmin rejects
  Closed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  note right of Submitted
    Draft, ManagerApproval and AwaitingConfirmation
    exist in the enum but no endpoint sets them
  end note
